  "description": "The Innokin GO Z Tank is a lightweight, versatile tank designed for vapers who value convenience and performance. With a 2ml capacity, this tank is built for easy refilling thanks to its intuitive sliding top-fill mechanism, which minimises spills and hassle. Engineered for flexibility, the GO Z Tank is compatible with Innokin’s Z-Coil series, renowned for delivering exceptional flavour and vapour. The tank comes pre-installed with a 1.6ohm coil for a satisfying MTL (mouth-to-lung) vape, making it ideal for high-PG and Nic Salt e-liquids. For those who prefer a looser RDTL (restricted direct-to-lung) draw, the tank supports 0.8ohm Z-Coils, sold separately. Adjustable airflow control lets you customise your vaping experience, whether you enjoy a tight, focused draw or a more open inhale. With its durable construction and sleek design, the Innokin GO Z Tank offers reliable performance and stylish functionality for everyday use.",
